INSERT INTO google_book values ("VkgDAwAAQBAJ", "Math Practice, Grade 3", '{"kind":"books#volume","id":"VkgDAwAAQBAJ","etag":"MEiWIuYXJn4","selfLink":"https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/VkgDAwAAQBAJ","volumeInfo":{"title":"Math Practice, Grade 3","publisher":"Carson-Dellosa Publishing","publishedDate":"2014-03-15","description":"Kelley Wingate''s Math Practice for third grade is designed to help students master basic math skills through focused math practice. Practice pages will be leveled in order to target each student''s individual needs for support. Some pages will provide clear, step-by-step examples. The basic skills covered include basic multiplication and division, fractions, rectangular arrays and area, analyzing two-dimensional shapes, and a comprehensive selection of other third grade math skills. This well-known series, Kelley Wingate, has been updated to align content to the Common Core State Standards. The 128-page books will provide a strong foundation of basic skills and will offer differentiated practice pages to make sure all students are well prepared to succeed in today''s Common Core classroom. The books will include Common Core standards matrices, cut-apart flash card sections, and award certificates. This series is designed to engage and recognize all learners, at school or at home.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9781483811000"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"148381100X"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":146,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Education"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"0.9.0.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=VkgDAwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=VkgDAwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api